/E (Our LoRa-based Smart Water Meter enables utilities and municipalities to transform traditional water metering into a connected, intelligent, and data-driven system. Designed for modern smart city infrastructure, it delivers accurate, real-time consumption data without the need for manual meter reading. Powered by low-power, long-range LoRa communication, the meter ensures reliable data transmission across wide urban and rural areas while operating for years on a single battery. This significantly reduces maintenance effort, field visits, and total operational costs.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
